jobs.description:
Are you accurate and do you enjoy working with different materials and machines? For our client in Waalwijk, we are looking for a Production Employee for the Preparation Department. Together with a team of four colleagues, you will transform bulk materials into precisely sized components used in the production of custom-made sandwich panels.

What will you do?

You will work with materials such as foam, wood, and composite. Using production lists, you will cut and calibrate these materials to the required dimensions.

- Adjust materials to the correct thickness using various saws and calibration machines;
- Cut materials to size at your own workstation;
- Calibrate material thickness using a thickness planer;
- Label components according to the production list and sort them onto transport carts;
- Keep your work area clean and organized.

Since every sandwich panel is custom-made, you will work with different production lists and dimensions every day.

What do we expect from you?

- You work accurately and enjoy working as part of a team;
- You can read production lists or are willing to learn;
- You speak Dutch or English.
